{
 "asset": "affect_text_rule_table",
 "about": "How the client merges the affects of one effect line (AffectTextUtil.CreateAffectText): affects with the same affectTextId are merged per parameter slot by the rule of their (prvs, baseAffect). A rule is the pvrsRuleList row of the condition, overridden by every non-Invalid slot of the baseAffectRuleList row of the BaseAffectType; a row needs 8 slots (GameConst.AffectParamCount). Invalid shows -1 (GameConst.InvalidAffectParam), Combine adds the values, Solo keeps one line per distinct value. One baseAffectRuleList row per BaseAffectType our affect_table uses: slot 0 (the amount) Combine, slot 1 Solo for the *_STYPE_* affects (it holds the StatueType). The AF_* action affects add their bases (slot 1 Solo for the ATRBT/STYPE targets) and condition rows for the conditions whose slot 2 holds seconds, an HP threshold or the holder tribe (Solo).",
 "sources": [
  {
   "source": "jdr-research",
   "doc": "docs/research/16-minds.md \u00a78",
   "note": "field layout, lookup order, the 8-slot copy and the three RuleType values read in the client (AffectTextRuleTable.GetParametor 0xC8FC2C, AffectTextUtil.CreateAffectText 0xDABD54, CombineParam 0xDAD198)"
  },
  {
   "source": "jdr-default",
   "note": "the rows are ours: the shipped table is empty and no source has the original rules"
  },
  {
   "source": "jdr-default",
   "note": "rows for the AF_* action affects (tools/content/action_vocab.py): slot 0 Combine, slot 1 Solo for the ATRBT/STYPE target bases, slot 2 Solo for the DEFEAT, ASSIST_USE, ATRBT, OVER_HP and UNDER_HP conditions (seconds, HP threshold, holder tribe)"
  }
 ],
